From a7b0ef0c12241979e32893ad0c04110a38c31042 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "copilot-swe-agent[bot]" <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Apr 2026 15:06:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Improve cloudtrail backend: secondary indexes, error
 sentinels, O(1) lookups, Reset(), sorted output

- Add ErrChannelNotFound, ErrDashboardNotFound, ErrEventDataStoreNotFound, ErrQueryNotFound sentinels
- Add channelsByARN/Name, dashboardsByARN/Name, edsByARN/Name secondary indexes for O(1) lookups
- Add Reset() method that closes all Tags and re-initializes all maps/counters
- Fix findTrailLocked to use trailsByARN index (O(1)) instead of O(n) loop
- Sort DescribeTrails output by Name; sort ListTrails output by TrailARN
- Fix EventDataStore status from 'CREATED' to 'ENABLED'
- Fix Dashboard status from 'CREATING' to 'CREATED'
- Add name uniqueness checks in CreateChannel, CreateDashboard, CreateEventDataStore
- Rewrite Delete{Channel,Dashboard,EventDataStore} to use O(1) index lookups
- Add findResourceTagsLocked helper for tag ops on any resource type
- Update AddTags/RemoveTags/ListTags to use findResourceTagsLocked
- Add queryID empty validation to CancelQuery and DescribeQuery
- Update handler.handleError to map new error types to HTTP 404
- Rebuild secondary indexes in Restore() from snapshot state
- Update tests for new status values

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

